    backlog:archivedAt "2026-11-08T18:06:11+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    backlog:hasLineageStatus backlog:LS_Archived ;
    backlog:lineageArchived true ;
    rdfs:comment "Correction appended 2026-11-08: the archival trigger above is the archive tool's standard text and says the mission was Achieved. It was not: the mission of Lineage 2 is Abandoned (replaced on 2026-11-04), its closure report marked Cancelled; its items were cancelled on the Owner's ruling IP-R5 before it was set down."@en .

pcl:Lineage03 backlog:archivalTrigger "Found achieved and un-archived by backlog_lineage_archive_v2_1_0: mission Out_Achieved, closure report present, every item Done or Cancelled, not frozen. Owner's rule 2026-09-09: an achieved lineage found triggers the archival activity." ;
