pcl:Del4_D10 a backlog:ScopeDeliverable ;
    rdfs:label "The release gate runs, for every live lineage, the checks of the rule sets it adopted (the validator, the order check, the release-item check), so a release that moves no item and cites no dated Owner ruling fails"@en ;
