    rdfs:comment "Correction appended 2026-11-08: this deliverable's wording assumed a ruling was needed on how to set down a lineage concluded before its items had to be closed. The premise was wrong (the framework has required every item closed since September); the Owner ruled (IP-R5, 21:03 Istanbul) that the items are closed first, and Lineage 2 was set down in IPage 1.13.0, before this lineage's backlog existed, on that ruling."@en .

