    backlog:hasRationale "Baseline read by measure_governance_v1_0_0.py on IPage v1.14.0 (9d90e53); the figure counts what is still missing, so the target is 0; it is the sum of its children's figures, as the goal tree sums the scope tree. A check counts as met only when the release gate refuses a planted fault for it, never by a file or a claim."^^xsd:string,
        "Used at four moments (ruling IP-R6): driving, at each sprint plan, where the open figure helps choose the next work; monitoring, at each release, where the gate prints and records it; control, at each release, where a figure that rises is raised as an obstacle with its route to correction; closure, the last reading, where 0 is achieved and anything else is recorded as missed."^^xsd:string ;
